    {
      "acf_fc_layout": "text_media",
      "heading": "Swimming Pools",
      "body": "<p>Guests can choose between two swimming pools: a larger pool with a shallow end and gentle slope, and a plunge pool on a lower deck overlooking the gardens, National Park, and spray from Victoria Falls.</p><p>Both pools are surrounded by timber decks with loungers, umbrellas, and cabana day beds. A poolside lounge offers open-plan seating, a writing desk, games table, books, USB chargers, and plug points, all conveniently located next to the Poolside Bar.</p>",
      "media_position": "right",
      "media_type": "gallery",
      "gallery": [
        { "url": "/images/Ilala-Lodge-Facilities-Pools-05.jpg", "alt": "Swimming Pools" },
        { "url": "/images/Ilala-Lodge-Facilities-Pools-30.jpg", "alt": "Swimming Pools" },
        { "url": "/images/Ilala-Lodge-Facilities-Pools-01.jpg", "alt": "Swimming Pools" }
      ],
      "section_theme": "accent",
      "spacing_top": "medium",
      "spacing_bottom": "medium",
      "anchor_id": "swimming-pools"
    },
    {
      "acf_fc_layout": "text_media",
      "heading": "Tours & Activities Desk",
      "body": "<p>The Tours & Activities Desk provides assistance with planning and booking experiences in and around Victoria Falls. The team can arrange activities, transfers, and river cruises, offering a convenient in-house service.</p>",
